WEBVTT

00:09.948 --> 00:10.865
Signore!

00:10.907 --> 00:12.617
You won't find a better price!

00:12.659 --> 00:14.535
The other guy said the same thing.

00:14.577 --> 00:16.787
Fine, I like you folks,
so I'll give you a personal tour!

00:16.871 --> 00:17.872
Huh? Really?

00:17.956 --> 00:19.207
What a character!

00:19.374 --> 00:20.750
Huh? W-What?!

00:20.792 --> 00:21.793
What's wrong?

00:21.876 --> 00:23.127
My bag…

00:23.127 --> 00:24.086
Huh?

00:24.128 --> 00:25.462
Here ya go.

00:25.672 --> 00:28.174
So, anything I should know about?

00:28.258 --> 00:30.635
No, Signore,
and we have you to thank!

00:30.760 --> 00:31.802
That so?

00:32.053 --> 00:33.512
I'll be off, then.

00:35.557 --> 00:37.016
This is whatcha want, right?

00:37.100 --> 00:38.684
That's the stuff.

00:38.768 --> 00:39.810
But…

00:39.894 --> 00:41.812
this is all I got.

00:42.105 --> 00:44.315
Then this is all you get.

00:54.951 --> 00:57.912
<i>The jewel of Southern Italy,
Napoli.</i>

00:57.996 --> 01:00.540
<i>A world-renowned city
whose match less beauty</i>

01:00.623 --> 01:04.001
<i>and breathtaking views inspired
the phrase "See Naples and Die."</i>

01:04.752 --> 01:06.378
Excuse me!

01:06.921 --> 01:09.673
How do you get to
the Church of Santa Chiara?

01:09.716 --> 01:11.968
Oh, Santa Chiara, well…

01:12.010 --> 01:14.345
If you go straight here,
then at the first signal…

01:14.429 --> 01:16.180
Ah, I knew it!

01:16.264 --> 01:17.598
It is that way!

01:17.640 --> 01:19.058
Okay, you were right!

01:19.142 --> 01:20.143
Thank you ve—

01:20.476 --> 01:21.518
Oops.

01:21.644 --> 01:22.728
Are you all right?

01:22.812 --> 01:25.064
Th-Thank you.

01:25.398 --> 01:26.899
Um, I'm sorry.

01:26.983 --> 01:29.527
Damn, dim-witted bitch!

01:35.783 --> 01:36.742
Come on, let's go.

01:36.826 --> 01:37.868
Um…

01:38.161 --> 01:39.245
You dropped this.

01:39.329 --> 01:41.247
Huh? Oh!

01:42.040 --> 01:43.708
Thank you so much!

01:44.000 --> 01:45.001
Sure.

01:45.501 --> 01:47.920
That guy was so debonair!

01:47.962 --> 01:49.880
Should've snuck a pic.

01:50.006 --> 01:51.007
Huh?

01:51.174 --> 01:53.593
Did they just fly out of my bag?

01:53.676 --> 01:56.136
Didn't they just land there?

01:56.387 --> 01:57.805
Yeah, you're right.

02:04.604 --> 02:05.813
Don't forget, in Napoli…

02:05.855 --> 02:07.398
vigilance is a virtue.

02:10.401 --> 02:11.735
Scusi.

02:11.861 --> 02:14.613
A cioccolato and pistacchio,
please.

02:17.575 --> 02:18.784
Make it two.

02:18.826 --> 02:19.827
Va bene.

02:38.471 --> 02:42.971
EPISODE 01
GOLDEN WIND

02:39.305 --> 02:42.349
Come on, no license, no work!

02:42.392 --> 02:43.476
Don't make me say it again!

02:43.559 --> 02:43.789
Get a move on. Move!

02:45.645 --> 02:46.604
Cazzo…

02:46.646 --> 02:48.773
- You only moved one car down!
- Signore.

02:48.815 --> 02:50.775
So? No waiting in line with me.

02:51.025 --> 02:52.776
- What do you think?
- Hmm…

02:53.194 --> 02:55.029
Downtown for a good price.

02:55.071 --> 02:56.947
Yeah? How much?

03:00.618 --> 03:02.453
L-Luca!

03:05.581 --> 03:08.166
Fork over the street tax
you owe me,

03:08.251 --> 03:10.628
then you get to do business,
remember?

03:10.670 --> 03:12.171
Have mercy, please!

03:12.255 --> 03:16.509
- I told you, taxes first, then work.
- But…

03:16.592 --> 03:17.759
I don't think I'm going senile!

03:17.802 --> 03:19.386
I have a family…

03:27.603 --> 03:29.354
Please no!

03:29.564 --> 03:33.568
Remember, friendship is
thicker than blood.

03:33.609 --> 03:34.234
Got it?

03:34.235 --> 03:37.780
It's not just me dealing
behind your back!

03:39.866 --> 03:40.867
Who else?

03:41.993 --> 03:43.577
Who is it?

03:44.287 --> 03:47.123
It's Giorno. Giorno Giovanna.

03:47.331 --> 03:48.373
Giorno?

03:48.458 --> 03:51.627
And he's been making a killing.

03:52.295 --> 03:53.337
Really…

03:53.421 --> 03:55.256
Giorno.

03:56.007 --> 03:56.924
Well…

03:56.966 --> 03:59.426
That's all well and good, but…

04:01.929 --> 04:03.055
Hey, you!

04:03.139 --> 04:06.016
No license, no work! Got it?!

04:06.058 --> 04:07.142
Beat it!

04:07.602 --> 04:09.145
Buon giorno!

04:11.981 --> 04:14.149
I finally made it!

04:15.234 --> 04:17.069
What a journey!

04:18.488 --> 04:20.907
Wow, I'm definitely not in
Japan anymore…

04:20.990 --> 04:23.158
All right, time to
get down to business.

04:23.826 --> 04:25.327
Haruno Shiobana.

04:25.453 --> 04:27.538
What a weird name.

04:27.663 --> 04:29.039
First, the hotel.

04:29.415 --> 04:32.209
Then I can finally
get rid of these bags!

04:33.169 --> 04:35.421
Let's see, a taxi stand…

04:35.505 --> 04:37.423
Look at this guy go!

04:37.507 --> 04:40.510
I know? That's one helluva trick!

04:40.551 --> 04:42.344
Do you know anyone who can do that
with their ear…

04:42.345 --> 04:45.097
How does he even do that?

04:46.098 --> 04:48.183
So freakin' creepy!

04:48.184 --> 04:50.978
How's his whole ear fit in there?

04:51.354 --> 04:52.104
Wow…

04:52.146 --> 04:54.064
Boy, you just made my day!

04:54.148 --> 04:55.149
Grazie.

04:57.777 --> 05:01.238
Just keep it on
the down-low, got it?

05:03.074 --> 05:03.908
Taxi?

05:03.991 --> 05:06.034
No! I-I'm fine.

05:06.077 --> 05:07.078
Taxi?

05:07.119 --> 05:10.413
I'm heading home for the day,
so I'll give you a deal.

05:10.623 --> 05:12.916
How 'bout one hundred eighty thousand lira
to the center of town?

05:13.167 --> 05:14.668
One hundred eighty thousand…

05:14.710 --> 05:17.421
That's about ten thousand yen.

05:17.421 --> 05:18.422
No way!

05:18.506 --> 05:20.257
That's double the going rate.

05:21.509 --> 05:22.301
Your Italian…

05:22.385 --> 05:24.553
- It's excellent.
- Huh?

05:24.595 --> 05:26.263
Did you use to live in Italy?

05:26.430 --> 05:29.433
Oh, I just had Rohan-Sensei…

05:29.517 --> 05:31.352
But anyway, that's not important!

05:31.394 --> 05:33.979
Are you really going to drive?

05:34.146 --> 05:37.065
You look like you're in
junior high or high school.

05:37.441 --> 05:39.484
And what was that
you handed to the guard?

05:39.610 --> 05:41.111
I thought I saw cash.

05:41.195 --> 05:41.945
So what was it?

05:42.029 --> 05:44.614
Relax, don't worry yourself
about any of that.

05:44.866 --> 05:46.576
All right, ten thousand lira then.

05:46.909 --> 05:48.035
And you don't have to tip.

05:48.202 --> 05:49.828
Ten thousand lira,
straight downtown.

05:49.954 --> 05:52.247
What? Ten thousand lira is about…

05:52.373 --> 05:53.374
Five hundred yen?!

05:53.416 --> 05:55.709
Uh, that won't be necessary.

05:55.751 --> 05:57.961
I'll just wait like everyone…

05:59.922 --> 06:01.006
Well?

06:02.925 --> 06:04.301
Really, ten thousand?

06:04.468 --> 06:05.510
Ten thousand.

06:05.595 --> 06:08.014
But you carry your own bags.

06:08.389 --> 06:10.182
No tip, remember?

06:11.893 --> 06:13.477
Bags up in front.

06:13.686 --> 06:15.562
You, Signore, in the back.

06:16.856 --> 06:18.482
I should warn you,

06:18.524 --> 06:20.943
I'm not some naive
Japanese tourist,

06:20.985 --> 06:22.653
so I advise you to keep
your assumptions in check.

06:22.945 --> 06:25.906
This car better be going straight
to my hotel.

06:26.198 --> 06:26.990
Certo.

06:27.033 --> 06:29.035
Straight to your hotel,
right away, signore.

06:30.494 --> 06:33.246
I assure you, your bag will arrive
good and empty.

06:35.666 --> 06:37.167
Huh? Wait…

06:37.376 --> 06:39.169
I haven't gotten in yet.

06:39.295 --> 06:40.921
Pretend you didn't see him.

06:41.672 --> 06:42.673
No!

06:42.757 --> 06:43.924
Stop!

06:44.425 --> 06:45.426
Ciao!

06:45.718 --> 06:47.136
Reverb, Act 3.

06:56.729 --> 06:58.480
How unfortunate.

06:59.732 --> 07:02.568
I told you to keep
your assumptions in check.

07:03.444 --> 07:05.404
Look, if you want to run away,
that's fine by me.

07:05.488 --> 07:08.157
All I want is my bag and
the stuff that was inside.

07:12.787 --> 07:15.873
Look!
Giorno must've botched the job.

07:15.957 --> 07:17.708
Well, he's half Japanese.

07:17.792 --> 07:20.586
What'd he expect
scamming a Japanese tourist?

07:20.670 --> 07:24.090
Then again, with that hair color
and a name like Giorno Giovanna,

07:24.173 --> 07:26.967
not many folks would think
he's not Italian.

07:27.426 --> 07:28.552
No way…

07:30.304 --> 07:31.054
Hm?

07:31.097 --> 07:32.681
W-What? It's gone!

07:33.057 --> 07:34.183
How?

07:37.144 --> 07:39.312
That some sort of egg?

07:40.856 --> 07:41.898
Ack!

07:45.695 --> 07:48.239
This a Stand?
But… crap!

07:48.447 --> 07:50.240
I set foot in Italy and…

07:53.703 --> 07:55.037
It's not a Stand!

07:55.079 --> 07:57.831
It's a living, breathing thing!

07:58.207 --> 08:00.918
And how'd my suitcase
just disappear?

08:01.168 --> 08:03.003
He couldn't have hidden it that fast!

08:03.045 --> 08:06.173
Ah… What's happening?!

08:08.009 --> 08:09.802
Guess it couldn't hurt…

08:10.052 --> 08:11.094
Scusi!

08:12.013 --> 08:14.807
About that cab driver…

08:18.519 --> 08:20.270
<i>Any minute now…</i>

08:26.610 --> 08:29.529
Giorno Giovanna, no?

08:34.201 --> 08:37.245
We haven't met, have we, Giorno?

08:37.413 --> 08:39.456
Do you have any idea who I am?

08:39.623 --> 08:41.499
Leaky Eye Luca.

08:41.667 --> 08:44.961
When a dispute turned ugly,
you took a knife to the face,

08:45.004 --> 08:48.090
but kept fighting and swinging,
deep stab wound and all.

08:48.382 --> 08:52.882
Complications left you
with that perpetually leaking eye.

08:55.723 --> 08:58.559
Here, make yourself comfortable.

09:00.603 --> 09:02.396
What are you waiting for? Sit.

09:02.646 --> 09:05.482
It hurts my eyes to look up
while I talk to you.

09:06.776 --> 09:08.611
So, how old are you?

09:08.903 --> 09:10.070
Fifteen.

09:10.112 --> 09:11.154
Fifteen?

09:11.322 --> 09:13.949
Still wet behind the ears!

09:13.991 --> 09:17.369
You know, Giorno,
any <i>True</i> friendship

09:17.453 --> 09:19.746
demands the three "T's."

09:19.830 --> 09:21.248
That's three "T's."

09:21.624 --> 09:24.251
One is Truth.

09:24.460 --> 09:26.253
Two, Tolerance.

09:26.587 --> 09:29.214
Last, but not least, Tribute.

09:29.507 --> 09:32.968
Make sense? Those are
the three "T's" of <i>True</i> friendship.

09:33.302 --> 09:34.845
Something I can help you with?

09:35.262 --> 09:37.806
I wasn't done talking, so shut it!

09:37.807 --> 09:40.726
No one said you could
ask a question, Stronzo!

09:40.893 --> 09:44.605
I hear you picked up
a side job at the airport, huh?

09:45.689 --> 09:47.607
But it's the strangest thing,

09:47.650 --> 09:51.528
I've yet to receive any tribute
from you, Giorno.

09:51.779 --> 09:55.574
And without it, how could
we remain <i>True</i> friends?

09:55.825 --> 09:57.493
Now show me that wallet!

09:57.576 --> 10:01.204
Signore Luca, if it's tribute
you're after, I've already paid.

10:01.497 --> 10:02.539
I have no money.

10:02.540 --> 10:04.208
You mean to that guard?

10:04.333 --> 10:08.045
That bastard's got nothing
to do with me!

10:09.004 --> 10:11.881
What the hell is this?
A family photo?

10:11.924 --> 10:14.384
Where's the money? Pay up!

10:14.510 --> 10:15.385
The wallet!

10:15.469 --> 10:16.761
Signore Luca…

10:17.096 --> 10:19.890
I really hate to repeat myself.

10:20.182 --> 10:22.893
As I already told you,
I owe you nothing.

10:23.185 --> 10:24.060
Huh?

10:24.061 --> 10:26.229
Now please don't make me
say it a third time.

10:31.026 --> 10:33.319
Testa di cazzo!

10:34.280 --> 10:36.490
What the hell is that thing?

10:37.700 --> 10:38.826
He's back.

10:38.868 --> 10:40.411
Now flick that thing off!

10:40.703 --> 10:42.705
The frog has nothing
to do with this.

10:42.746 --> 10:44.289
Please don't ask me that.

10:44.373 --> 10:46.917
It wasn't a suggestion, amico!

10:47.209 --> 10:49.127
I also told you to pay up!

10:49.211 --> 10:51.880
Are you refusing both my orders?

10:52.214 --> 10:56.509
Are you saying "no" twice
to Leaky Eye Luca?

10:56.594 --> 10:59.305
He's a living creature
with his own will.

10:59.555 --> 11:01.181
He thinks for himself.

11:01.640 --> 11:03.308
I suggest we go our separate ways.

11:03.392 --> 11:04.726
- You are…
- Flicking him off

11:04.727 --> 11:08.105
- You are…
- Is something I just can't do.

11:08.230 --> 11:10.357
Stop! He's harmless
if you leave him alone!

11:10.399 --> 11:13.485
Get ready to die!

11:20.451 --> 11:22.453
I told you to stop.

11:22.828 --> 11:26.665
His loyalty to me
is not yet absolute.

11:26.749 --> 11:30.127
He's only protecting himself.

11:30.336 --> 11:32.963
Inside him is his own vital force.

11:37.801 --> 11:39.803
An attack on him…

11:39.929 --> 11:43.766
is an attack on oneself,
and a fatal one.

11:45.267 --> 11:46.434
Also…

11:47.144 --> 11:50.689
I kindly asked you to not make me
repeat myself a third time.

11:51.190 --> 11:53.483
Repeating oneself is futile…

11:54.109 --> 11:55.401
"Muda" as they say…

11:55.694 --> 11:57.320
I hate wasting my breath.

11:58.030 --> 11:59.239
Muda, muda…

12:06.413 --> 12:08.998
A skin sample from this kid?

12:09.291 --> 12:10.083
Yeah.

12:10.125 --> 12:12.502
I want you to secure the sample,
and send it to me, Koichi.

12:13.087 --> 12:16.173
The Speedwagon Foundation
will examine his genetic make-up.

12:16.632 --> 12:19.051
Genetic make-up?
Who is this guy?

12:19.343 --> 12:22.137
His dead father was,
you could say, unique.

12:22.471 --> 12:24.014
Hence the analysis.

12:24.223 --> 12:27.267
An epidermal sample will suffice.
I don't need much.

12:27.768 --> 12:29.311
That's all.

12:30.562 --> 12:32.522
Your travel expenses
will be paid in full by me.

12:32.690 --> 12:34.525
What? All of it?

12:34.692 --> 12:37.528
Hmm… Well, umm…

12:37.861 --> 12:40.405
This may sound a little weird,

12:40.489 --> 12:42.949
but this kid does sorta
resemble you, Mr. Jotaro.

12:46.161 --> 12:47.954
The address in this photo…

12:48.038 --> 12:50.040
Should be around here somewhere…

12:51.250 --> 12:52.876
They don't seem to be worried.

12:52.960 --> 12:54.753
There's no need to be concerned.

12:55.462 --> 12:59.716
Nobody around here would be
that foolish to steal their bag.

13:00.301 --> 13:04.096
Wow, this area must be pretty safe.

13:06.890 --> 13:07.807
Hey, can I sit next to you?

13:07.850 --> 13:09.560
Signore, may I interest you
in some lunch?

13:09.643 --> 13:10.769
- No way, I'm sitting there.
- No thanks.

13:10.853 --> 13:13.814
Hey, Giorno,
come have a drink with me!

13:13.856 --> 13:15.858
- I'll pay for it.
- Enough.

13:15.941 --> 13:17.192
I prefer to be alone.

13:17.276 --> 13:18.318
Go away.

13:18.360 --> 13:19.694
- Okay!
- Okay!

13:19.737 --> 13:21.572
A domani, Giorno!

13:21.655 --> 13:22.697
- Ciao!
- Ciao!

13:23.782 --> 13:25.742
It's him!

13:29.204 --> 13:32.665
Hey! That's my money!
You're spending my money!

13:32.708 --> 13:34.543
You…
How'd you know I was here?

13:34.585 --> 13:37.921
Give me back my passport!
Where's my bag?

13:37.963 --> 13:40.173
It pains me to say this…

13:40.341 --> 13:42.384
But I don't have it.
I already sold it.

13:42.551 --> 13:44.010
It's really too bad.

13:44.553 --> 13:46.221
So stop following me.

13:47.639 --> 13:49.515
Not this time!

13:49.558 --> 13:51.351
What's this heaviness?

13:52.019 --> 13:53.061
Could it…

13:53.145 --> 13:55.230
So that wasn't an accident?

13:55.647 --> 13:58.941
Could he have
the same powers as me?

13:59.902 --> 14:01.153
What'd he just say?

14:01.236 --> 14:02.278
The pressure!

14:04.114 --> 14:06.116
Golden Wind!

14:09.787 --> 14:11.789
Sprout forth… O seed of life!

14:12.164 --> 14:14.291
Emerge, new soul!

14:16.293 --> 14:18.295
There was something there.

14:18.295 --> 14:19.462
Act 3!

14:22.758 --> 14:24.259
The target has disappeared.

14:24.301 --> 14:25.135
Damn!

14:25.219 --> 14:28.555
How'd he break free from
3 Freeze so easily!

14:32.768 --> 14:34.311
I'll say it once more.

14:34.353 --> 14:36.229
I strongly suggest
you abandon following me.

14:36.897 --> 14:38.481
I loathe saying something
a second time

14:38.524 --> 14:40.359
when once is sufficient.

14:40.776 --> 14:43.737
Repeating oneself is
the epitome of futility.

14:44.321 --> 14:48.116
If I were you, I'd avoid wasting
your life on pointless activities.

14:49.410 --> 14:52.121
Take him down, Act 3!

14:56.333 --> 14:59.669
I hit the tree, and the force
ricocheted back to me?

15:00.129 --> 15:02.172
I stole your belongings…

15:03.632 --> 15:06.843
Yet you held back
when you attacked me.

15:06.885 --> 15:10.013
Your injuries tell me everything.

15:10.347 --> 15:12.515
You're a good soul.

15:15.102 --> 15:18.522
There's no doubt… Giorno Giovanna…

15:18.856 --> 15:19.898
He's…

15:19.982 --> 15:21.775
…a Stand user!

15:33.454 --> 15:35.539
GIORNO GIOVANNA
GOLDEN WIND

15:39.084 --> 15:39.918
Hello.

15:40.002 --> 15:41.795
<i>Jotaro! It's Koichi.</i>

15:42.045 --> 15:45.214
Koichi! Did you make it to Italy?

15:45.382 --> 15:46.549
<i>I found him!</i>

15:46.717 --> 15:49.386
<i>The kid you asked me to investigate…
Haruno Shiobana!</i>

15:49.845 --> 15:51.054
That was fast.

15:51.597 --> 15:53.307
Where do I begin?

15:53.891 --> 15:55.642
I ran into him at the airport.

15:56.101 --> 15:59.062
Okay, I'll get to the point.

15:59.730 --> 16:01.481
He's a Stand user!

16:01.857 --> 16:04.234
<i>He goes by Giorno Giovanna here.</i>

16:04.610 --> 16:06.111
<i>It's just like you said…</i>

16:06.528 --> 16:08.738
<i>Stand users are drawn
to each other.</i>

16:09.490 --> 16:11.658
It was all completely by chance.

16:12.034 --> 16:14.453
He looks like a student, but acts
like he's in some sort of gang.

16:14.870 --> 16:17.205
He stole my bag and all my money.

16:17.539 --> 16:19.832
<i>And then there's his Stand ability…</i>

16:20.042 --> 16:22.627
<i>Seems he can reflect attacks
right back at the attacker.</i>

16:23.045 --> 16:24.129
I'm sorry about all the trouble.

16:24.588 --> 16:27.132
I'll get you a hotel
and send some money.

16:27.841 --> 16:29.008
<i>Thank you, Mr. Jotaro.</i>

16:29.176 --> 16:31.845
<i>And he's blond,
not like the picture.</i>

16:32.054 --> 16:33.805
<i>When I talked to people
who know him,</i>

16:34.223 --> 16:35.515
<i>they told me
he didn't dye his hair.</i>

16:35.807 --> 16:37.934
<i>They said it just changed,
and recently.</i>

16:38.519 --> 16:40.562
<i>Something about inheriting it
from his deceased father.</i>

16:41.188 --> 16:42.606
<i>About his father…</i>

16:43.732 --> 16:46.484
<i>Mr. Jotaro,
are you two somehow related?</i>

16:51.198 --> 16:52.449
His father…

16:53.200 --> 16:54.451
I killed him…

16:56.078 --> 16:57.913
His name was DIO Brando.

16:59.081 --> 17:00.082
DIO?

17:00.457 --> 17:02.459
You mean DIO
with the bow and arrow?

17:02.918 --> 17:04.628
I learned this year…

17:05.045 --> 17:07.130
DIO may have fathered a child.

17:07.589 --> 17:09.215
I needed to uncover the truth.

17:09.716 --> 17:12.468
I need to know whether
Giorno Giovanna is DIO's son,

17:12.928 --> 17:15.931
and if he is, how much
he takes after his father.

17:16.557 --> 17:19.560
<i>But DIO's body
belonged to a Joestar…</i>

17:19.977 --> 17:21.561
His new golden hair may be proof

17:22.437 --> 17:26.937
DIO's blood only recently
awakened his Stand power.

17:28.068 --> 17:29.319
Something triggered it…

17:29.444 --> 17:33.944
A powerful Stand user
may have arrived in Napoli…

17:34.449 --> 17:36.451
<i>A powerful Stand user?!</i>

17:36.785 --> 17:38.328
Keep your distance.

17:38.954 --> 17:40.288
You've been through enough already.

17:40.956 --> 17:41.957
Got it?

17:44.418 --> 17:45.669
<i>One last thing…</i>

17:46.587 --> 17:48.171
Does he seem to be a true enemy?

17:48.505 --> 17:50.465
Or does he show potential
as an ally?

17:51.717 --> 17:54.678
What do you think?
You're the only one who's met him.

17:55.429 --> 17:57.222
<i>What could you tell
about his character?</i>

18:00.684 --> 18:02.686
I can't say for sure, but…

18:03.312 --> 18:05.188
There was… well…

18:05.856 --> 18:08.358
…a certain eloquence about him.

18:24.875 --> 18:25.876
Is that yours?

18:26.084 --> 18:27.085
No.

18:27.336 --> 18:29.338
Hmm… I see…

18:29.588 --> 18:30.797
My lucky day…

18:33.342 --> 18:34.343
If…

18:34.551 --> 18:39.051
you found a bag here
with a billion lira inside,

18:39.139 --> 18:40.140
would you turn it in?

18:41.266 --> 18:43.726
You're joking.
Finders keepers, right?

18:45.062 --> 18:46.271
At least you're honest.

18:46.647 --> 18:50.817
What if I was an undercover cop
and saw the whole thing?

18:52.694 --> 18:57.194
I'd let you walk with half
to turn the other way… perhaps.

19:01.203 --> 19:02.871
Now that's the spirit!

19:02.913 --> 19:05.123
You know,
I get the sense you really would!

19:05.499 --> 19:08.418
I think you're completely serious,
no bluff!

19:08.710 --> 19:11.003
You're speaking the truth!

19:11.338 --> 19:15.508
I have a knack for telling
whether someone's being truthful.

19:15.717 --> 19:17.677
I seldom slip up.

19:18.011 --> 19:20.930
For instance, the face will often
glisten with sweat.

19:21.098 --> 19:22.766
That's often the first giveaway.

19:23.225 --> 19:27.312
But it's the flavor of one's sweat
that is truly telling.

19:29.231 --> 19:31.107
Who are you?

19:32.567 --> 19:36.362
Leaky Eye Luca got his head
bashed in with his own shovel,

19:36.405 --> 19:38.657
and was found unconscious
on the outskirts of the airport.

19:38.865 --> 19:40.783
And he's not going to come to.

19:40.909 --> 19:41.951
He's critical.

19:42.077 --> 19:44.412
And I'm looking for the culprit!

19:44.913 --> 19:46.122
Giorno Giovanna…

19:46.415 --> 19:50.293
No one has the slightest idea why
Leaky Eye Luca was at the airport.

19:50.836 --> 19:51.837
However…

19:52.295 --> 19:56.795
An airport security guard
told me you were there.

19:57.467 --> 20:01.262
So I thought we'd have
a quick chat about the matter.

20:01.763 --> 20:03.556
Are you a cop?

20:03.598 --> 20:05.057
You aren't serious!

20:06.059 --> 20:08.186
Luca wasn't some punk.

20:08.270 --> 20:09.479
He belonged to a gang.

20:09.563 --> 20:11.606
A lot of people
had reason to do him in.

20:11.857 --> 20:14.317
He was well-hated, so to speak.

20:14.776 --> 20:19.030
But that's not how
his boss sees things.

20:19.531 --> 20:21.324
A member of the family
has been slaughtered,

20:21.324 --> 20:24.076
and his honor has been
severely compromised.

20:24.453 --> 20:26.538
That's why he ordered me
to find the perpetrator,

20:26.621 --> 20:28.623
and sort things out.

20:29.040 --> 20:30.916
So my question to you is…

20:31.376 --> 20:35.421
Did you or did you not
meet Leaky Eye Luca at the airport?

20:35.714 --> 20:37.674
No, never heard of him.

20:49.227 --> 20:50.645
You're not perspiring.

20:51.396 --> 20:52.939
All right, I believe you.

20:54.316 --> 20:55.608
I have no more questions.

20:56.151 --> 20:58.361
Sorry to have bothered,
Giorno Giovanna.

21:07.996 --> 21:09.872
Wha—?!

21:11.500 --> 21:13.210
What the hell—?!

21:13.668 --> 21:15.127
My fist was clenched!

21:15.170 --> 21:16.880
You're looking at Luca's right eye.

21:17.214 --> 21:20.383
He was out cold,
so I thought I'd bring them along.

21:22.803 --> 21:23.887
Well, what a surprise…

21:24.137 --> 21:25.805
I taste the distinct tang
of a liar.

21:26.264 --> 21:27.598
Giorno Giovanna!

21:29.810 --> 21:34.310
I did say no more questions…

21:34.564 --> 21:36.524
But the game has changed,

21:37.150 --> 21:39.068
Giorno Giovanna.

21:39.736 --> 21:41.529
I now know you're a liar!

21:42.030 --> 21:43.948
Now why would you be lying?

21:44.407 --> 21:48.327
I'm really very interested
in what you have to say!

21:51.540 --> 21:52.958
Like what you see?

21:53.041 --> 21:56.169
Are you jealous?
Wanna join in on the fun?

21:58.171 --> 22:00.590
My name is Bruno Bucciarati.

22:01.049 --> 22:02.091
Answer me.

22:02.384 --> 22:05.929
We've already progressed from
questioning to torture.

22:10.642 --> 22:13.311
Tell me, terrifying trick,
isn't it?

22:13.478 --> 22:16.272
- Th-This is…?!
- Those are Luca's fingers.

22:17.107 --> 22:21.607
I have to admit, my boss
finished off Leaky Eye Luca.

22:22.696 --> 22:25.407
He saw no sense
in keeping him alive.

22:25.448 --> 22:27.366
- His fingers make
<i>- Not again!</i>

22:27.367 --> 22:28.659
- A fabulous torture tool.
<i>- What'd he do?</i>

22:29.411 --> 22:33.081
<i>Could he have abilities
like that Japanese tourist?</i>

22:33.123 --> 22:35.667
Besides my lie detecting abilities,

22:35.750 --> 22:37.460
I have a few other tricks
up my sleeve.

22:38.044 --> 22:41.797
I can fit just about anything
into your mouth.

22:42.382 --> 22:43.466
For example…

22:43.717 --> 22:47.804
I can slide that extinguisher
between your jaws easy peasy.

22:48.096 --> 22:51.808
Of course, if I did,
you would no longer have a pulse.

22:56.354 --> 22:57.355
Spit it out!

22:57.647 --> 22:59.940
You witnessed the offender…

23:00.400 --> 23:02.110
Were you paid to keep quiet?

23:02.277 --> 23:06.030
You will tell me
who did that to Luca!

23:07.657 --> 23:08.824
<i>There's no doubt!</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:11.327
<i>He has the same abilities!</i>

23:11.494 --> 23:15.122
Out with it,
or the torture will intensify…

23:15.373 --> 23:17.541
Giorno Giovanna!

23:22.631 --> 23:24.341
<i>He's lethal!</i>

23:26.134 --> 23:28.010
<i>There's no other way…</i>

23:29.095 --> 23:31.180
<i>I have to use Golden Wind…</i>

23:31.473 --> 23:34.934
<i>I have to find a way to fightback!</i>

23:38.480 --> 23:42.066
EPISODE 02
BUCCIARATI APPEARS
